<title>USA: CCC seeks commodities for donation to Moldova.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks commodities for donation to Moldova.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of USDA said it will tender April 29 for pinto beans, sunflower oil, bulgur and wheat-soy blend for donation to Moldova.</p>
<p>It seeks 255 tonnes of pinto beans, 605 tonnes of sunflower oil, 510 tonnes of bulgur (a cracked wheat), and 255 tonnes of a wheat-soy blend.</p>
<p>The beans, bulgur and wheat-soy blend were for June 6-20 shipment and the oil was for June 20-July 5.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
